# VoiceAI - Real-Time Multimodal Voice Agent Platform

Sub-500ms voice-to-voice conversational AI with barge-in, turn-taking, streaming tool execution, and full observability.

## Quick Start

```bash
# 1. Install uv (if not installed)
curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh

# 2. Clone & install
git clone <this-repo>
cd VoiceAI
make install

# 3. Configure
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your API keys

# 4. Start infrastructure
docker compose up -d

# 5. Run server
make dev

# 6. Open browser client
open client/browser/index.html
```

## Architecture

See [PLAN.md](PLAN.md) for full implementation plan, latency budgets, and phase breakdown.

