## Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make dev` | Run server with hot reload |
| `make test` | Run unit tests |
| `make lint` | Run ruff linter |
| `make typecheck` | Run mypy type checker |
| `make benchmark` | Run latency benchmark |
| `make check` | Run lint + typecheck + test |

## Latency Targets

| Stage | Budget (p95) |
|-------|-------------|
| VAD end-of-speech | 40–70ms |
| ASR finalization | 150–300ms |
| TTFT (LLM) | 150–250ms |
| TTFA (TTS) | 100–150ms |
| Network + playout | 30–80ms |
| **Total E2E** | **< 600ms** |

